{"reviews":[{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-0","r":4.0,"t":"Great gift","x":"Amazon shipped just the box  with the product, I wish they would send the box for a gift inside another box so the label is not right on the box I\u2019m going to gift.  My friend really liked it, it smells great but it was a bit hard to close once it was opened.","h":190,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-1","r":5.0,"t":"Birthday surprise","x":"I purchased this for a friend\u2019s birthday. I had it shipped to her.  She absolutely loved it.  There was no way for me to leave a message for her letting her know that I was the one who gifted it when I ordered it.  Of course, it was a pleasant surprise.","h":186,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-2","r":5.0,"t":"Very Happy with the purchase","x":"This was a great hit.  I ordered it for my niece for her birthday.  It was delivered as promised, nicely boxed with a nice touch of a \"Happy Birthday\" note inside of it.  Would order again!","h":179,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great gift","x":"Second time I\u2019ve purchased this for birthday ladies.  They both loved it.","h":179,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-4","r":5.0,"t":"Good Buy!!","x":"Beautifully packaged, nice fragrances, quick delivery. Would buy again.","h":178,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great gift","x":"Great gift! Smells great too the birthday one was coconut scent.","h":172,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-6","r":4.0,"t":"Took a week to get but nice","x":"I bought it for a birthday gift for a friend and she loved it.  The only reason I didn\u2019t give it 5 stars is it was a one day delivery but took a week to get and was late for her birthday.  That was disappointing","h":158,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-7","r":5.0,"t":"Nice gift","x":"Bought this as a gift.  She absolutely loved it! Will def purchase more.","h":133,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-8","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent gift!","x":"My wife loved this set!  It smells great and she loves the lotion stuff\u2026 perfect gift!","h":131,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-9","r":5.0,"t":"Super cute !","x":"Box isn\u2019t too big or small. Perfect for a gift, gives some excitement going through the box and seeing what all you get.","h":126,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-10","r":5.0,"t":"Gift","x":"I gifted to my friend she love it. She was very happy with the bath bomb.","h":125,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-11","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect gift","x":"Got this as a birthday present for my grandma and she loved it. It was a great surprise.","h":124,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-12","r":2.0,"t":"Way to expensive for a no-name","x":"Too expensive for a no-name body care product. I couldn\u2019t find any details about the manufacturer or where it was made. The scent is okay and the cream is fine but I\u2019d like to have details about where it was made.","h":19,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-13","r":3.0,"t":"Great gift but small and overpriced","x":"I bought this for a friend's 50th birthday.  It turned out to be much smaller than I expected and therefore overpriced.  However, I'd give 4 stars for content.  I just wished the items were larger for what I paid.  That being said, I'd likely buy it again based on presentation alone.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-14","r":5.0,"t":"Smells wonderful.","x":"Very good smelling product. Recipient said there was no card inside to say who gift was from.  I purchased it, but I did not see on the screen any place to put a signature or message.  Sender should have put a card inside or sticker outside saying who gift was from.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-15","r":3.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"I loved the idea is this gift with a tumbler. I bought it for my mother for her birthday and when she got it,  the card didn't say happy birthday, the tumbler was not the white one in the photo for a birthday. I was truly disappointed because I had ordered it thinking it was going to be a birthday gift.","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-16","r":4.0,"t":"Great gift but you have to repackage it.","x":"Items in the box are great and i highly recommend.  The issue is with Amazon not shipping it inside another box.  Amazon labels were placed directly on the gift box and cannot be removed.  I took all the items out and placed them into a gift bag.  Taking off one star due to Amazons shipping.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-17","r":1.0,"t":"Great gift!","x":"Excellent gift for any mother, sister, or friend. Came with everything shown, and delivery was extremely quick.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-18","r":5.0,"t":"Great gift","x":"Bought it as a gift for a good friend and she loved it!  I'd consider buying it again for a friend.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-19","r":4.0,"t":"Comes in an amazon cardboard box","x":"Great box. However I do wish it came in a an actual gift box Versus just a plain Amazon cardboard box. I have to now spend more money to move the items to a gift box that doesn't say Amazon and has my address stamped on it.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-20","r":5.0,"t":"Love this!","x":"Such a pretty presentation! Perfect gift and the soaps and lotion smell awesome. It was a little expensive, but totally worth it. Highly recommend.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-21","r":5.0,"t":"My cousin loved it.  The scent was amazing as soon as the box was opened.","x":"This was a gift and I would by one for me and for another gift.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-22","r":5.0,"t":"Compact Beautiful Gift Set","x":"Great packaging and a thoughtful work gift","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-23","r":5.0,"t":"Color is NOT mint - it\u2019s just like the photo!","x":"Sent this to my best friend for her birthday. She loved it! Said the scents smelled good. Color is not \u201cmint\u201d as described. It\u2019s just like the photo - a turquoise/teal color which is what I was hoping for. Gift set has gone up in price since I bought it. Too expensive but super cute and shipped on time. Happy with my purchase.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B09K9JHDNX-24","r":5.0,"t":"Gift","x":"The product was fine- my friend loved it. However, there was supposed to be a gift card and receipt in the packaging and there was not. She searched twice. She had no idea who it was from! Not ok.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Recipients love it as a gift, especially for birthdays.","cites":[1,2,3,4,6,7,8,9,10,11,12,14]},{"text":"The product smells great and is nicely presented/packaged.","cites":[1,5,6,9,10,15]},{"text":"Some buyers found it overpriced or smaller than expected.","cites":[13,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers wished there was a way to include a gift message or card identifying the sender.","cites":[2,15]},{"text":"Shipping was mostly quick, though one order arrived late.","cites":[5,7]}]},"qa":[]}